cessories"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Likes: Everything to do with Kuri"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"One of Yuu's co-workers and someone like an older brother to him. His public face is a silver accessory designer who's attained a certain level of popularity, but he claims that that's nothing more than a hobby."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Although he dresses like a woman, it's merely his fashion style. He dotes madly on the woman named Kuri who's his partner in both private and work."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From the Official Artbook"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c50523"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/cb/cbf123c4be9a0c39d7e0ea1c09a36a2e8a4e6fc311d8cd28950e89ca384631be.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c8/c8fb7aee39536736ae1f2e18bcff8e54f4de02ad1995f9bd693efe0041a9bd59.webp","width":200,"height":200,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"泰 勇気","creatorId":"vndb:s1124","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1124","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1124","name":"泰 勇気","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:62049","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c50524","characterName":"七紙","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c50524"},"originalCharacterName":"七紙","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"14"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"158"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Hobbies: Collecting antiques"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Likes: Making money"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"The young owner of the mysterious shop called Nanashi-do. He loves money. Due to the shop name, people address him as Nanashi. He is so proud of his business that he never tries to rip his customers off or make underhanded deals."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"His power allows him to understand the thoughts and emotions within objects, which has resulted in his preference for hand-made products and tools that have been used for a long time."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From the Official Artbook"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c50524"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a1/a1c3d666b6d3c921720bd46251812355f76a48e17e823cb7ba8a3971988de526.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/57/57733f7960f76bdc6318f2a53fc288ab0dd30b29d3ad6ae9a5d5d4190d5bb750.webp","width":154,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"田中 茉理花","creatorId":"vndb:s2571","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s2571","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s2571","name":"田中 茉理花","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:62051","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c50525","characterName":"柏葉 禄郎","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c50525"},"originalCharacterName":"柏葉 禄郎","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"166"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Age: In his mid-20s (exact age unknown)"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Hobbies: Bodybuilding"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Likes: Feeling that he is growing stronger"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A man of uncertain age working for the Disobeyers' intelligence department. Apart from gathering information on incidents caused by Variants, he also protects those involved in them."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He is a maniac who finds the best thing in life to be forging his mind and body. Also, he is a fighting maniac who's always on the lookout for chances to test his strength."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From the Official Artbook"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c50525"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/1e/1e7df854cf039c9d72a065adceea12f4625340200bf067a2dae21da7cd847259.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/7c/7cf03e692d13479edb42b5dae65c94915def7d06f362bf9e991f23753a53a8e5.webp","width":139,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"滝 知史","creatorId":"vndb:s10191","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s10191","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s10191","name":"滝 知史","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:62057","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c50526","characterName":"オヤッサン","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c50526"},"originalCharacterName":"オヤッサン","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"172"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Age: In his 40s (exact age unknown)"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Hobbies: Inviting recipes"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Likes: Drinking after work"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"The manager of the ramen shop with the nickname of \"Noodle Graveyard\", which has been named after all the horrible dishes served there. His true identity is a highly skilled Disobeyer. In a regular company structure, he would be in position to supervise Yuu, Suzunari and many others, representing the Disobeyers in the region."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He Is best friends with Yuu's and Jun's fathers and treats their children like his own."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From the Official Artbook"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c50526"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/cc/cc03ab1e261f2d27ae1a057b3d96de48a3973cef261fbcb67d7f8e2454add6ea.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/42/424cc9470726b7faaa53f470c50add8f3b9cbc00e8e8555c3a4813a1393f39dd.webp","width":102,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"小林 範雄","creatorId":"vndb:s188","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s188","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s188","name":"小林 範雄","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:62047","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c50527","characterName":"東 統一郎","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c50527"},"originalCharacterName":"東 統一郎","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"29"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"178"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Hobbies: Gathering animal goods"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Likes: Falling back to sleep"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A police officer cooperating with the Amakawas. He belongs to the first division of the criminal investigation department which deals with murders and injuries. He is one of the coordinators with the Disobeyers in the police. His high abilities to reason and analyze have gained huge trust from Yuu."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Since he has to face people's malice on both sides of his jobs, he spends his private time without contacting others."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From the Official Artbook"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c50527"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConfli